WEBVTT

00:09.137 --> 00:10.482
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.551 --> 00:12.103
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.172 --> 00:13.586
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.655 --> 00:15.724
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.793 --> 00:18.655
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.724 --> 00:20.724
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.793 --> 00:22.793
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:22.862 --> 00:24.655
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.724 --> 00:26.620
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:26.689 --> 00:28.758
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.827 --> 00:30.689
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:30.758 --> 00:32.758
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.827 --> 00:34.724
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.793 --> 00:36.551
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:36.620 --> 00:38.862
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.931 --> 00:40.724
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.793 --> 00:42.068
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.137 --> 00:43.965
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:44.034 --> 00:46.689
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.758 --> 00:48.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.034 --> 00:50.379
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.103 --> 00:56.000
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:56.068 --> 01:03.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:03.965 --> 01:08.758
- End of another
18-hour shift of misery.
- 另一个的结束
18小时轮班的痛苦。

01:08.827 --> 01:11.896
- Ooh! Ahoy there!
- 哦！哎哟！

01:11.965 --> 01:15.344
And what do you two laddies
have planned for this weekend?
你们两个女士怎么办？
这个周末有计划吗？

01:15.413 --> 01:17.793
- I'm polishing Gary's shell.
- 我正在擦亮加里的外壳。

01:17.862 --> 01:20.620
[whirring]
[呼呼]

01:20.689 --> 01:21.827
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:23.344 --> 01:24.586
[growls]
[咆哮]

01:24.655 --> 01:28.137
Well, I'm going
to a post-post-pre-modern
嗯，我这就去
到后后前现代

01:28.206 --> 01:31.551
unconstructivist
dance performance.
非建构主义
舞蹈表演。

01:31.620 --> 01:35.103
[futuristic music]
[未来派音乐]

01:35.172 --> 01:38.448
- Uh, well, that's fascinating.
- 呃，这很有趣。

01:38.517 --> 01:39.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:39.689 --> 01:41.965
Hey, instead of that malarkey,
嘿，不是那个胡说八道的人，

01:42.034 --> 01:44.655
what would you say
to a leisurely weekend
你会说什么
到一个悠闲的周末

01:44.724 --> 01:47.586
sailing trip
on me brand-new yacht?
航海之旅
在我全新的游艇上？

01:47.655 --> 01:49.000
Huh?
[chuckles]
啊？
[笑声]

01:49.068 --> 01:50.896
The sun in your face. Huh?
阳光照在你的脸上。啊？

01:50.965 --> 01:52.206
- Ooh.
- 哦。

01:52.275 --> 01:54.827
[laughs laboriously]
[吃力地笑]

01:54.896 --> 01:56.482
- The wind in your--
- 你的风--

01:56.551 --> 01:58.448
uh, head wrinkles.
嗯，头上有皱纹。

01:58.517 --> 02:00.241
- [sighs] Hmm.
- [叹气] 嗯。

02:00.310 --> 02:05.931
Well, I wouldn't mind a nice,
relaxing ocean cruise.
嗯，我不介意一个好的，
轻松的海洋巡游。

02:06.000 --> 02:07.034
- Great.
- 伟大的。

02:07.103 --> 02:08.241
I'll see you at the dock
我会在码头见你

02:08.310 --> 02:10.344
bright and early
tomorrow morning.
又亮又早
明天早上。

02:12.896 --> 02:16.275
- [humming]
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:16.344 --> 02:18.827
- [sighs]
Mm-hmm.
- [叹气]
嗯嗯。

02:18.896 --> 02:22.000
- Mr. Krabs, I'm all dressed up
and ready to...
- 螃蟹先生，我已经盛装打扮了
并准备...

02:22.068 --> 02:23.344
snorkel.
通气管。

02:23.413 --> 02:25.344
- Wait a second.
- 等一下。

02:25.413 --> 02:27.655
- Uh, Mr. Krabs,
where's your ship?
- 呃，蟹老板先生，
你的船在哪里？

02:27.724 --> 02:30.689
- Something smells fishy.
- 有股鱼腥味。

02:30.758 --> 02:32.724
- Don't get your mizzenmast
in a twist.
- 不要抓住你的后桅
在一个转折中。

02:32.793 --> 02:35.310
I got your ship right here.
我已经把你的船放在这里了。

02:35.379 --> 02:36.793
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

02:36.862 --> 02:39.724
[chuckles]
Some assembly required.
[笑声]
需要一些组装。

02:39.793 --> 02:42.517
- We have to build the ship?
- 我们必须建造这艘船？

02:42.586 --> 02:45.586
- Yay!
We get to build the ship!
- 耶！
我们要建造这艘船！

02:45.655 --> 02:47.931
- Premade vessels
are for landlubbers.
- 预制容器
是给旱鸭子的。

02:48.000 --> 02:50.965
Real sailors
build their own ships.
真正的水手
建造自己的船只。

02:51.034 --> 02:52.482
Now get to work, you two.
现在开始工作吧，你们两个。

02:52.551 --> 02:54.655
And as an old Navy man,
作为一名老海军，

02:54.724 --> 02:57.551
I'll be responsible
for the most difficult part.
我会负责
对于最困难的部分。

02:57.620 --> 03:00.103
- And that would be?
- 那会是吗？

03:00.172 --> 03:01.724
- Supervising.
- 监督。

03:01.793 --> 03:02.896
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:02.965 --> 03:06.206
[snoring]
[打鼾]

03:06.275 --> 03:08.206
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:08.275 --> 03:10.103
Old Navy man?
老海军？

03:10.172 --> 03:13.724
Ha! More like old, lazy man.
哈!更像是又老又懒的人。

03:13.793 --> 03:15.137
Hmm.
唔。

03:15.206 --> 03:16.586
[sighs]
Oh, boy.
[叹气]
哦，男孩。

03:16.655 --> 03:18.655
All right,
let's get this over with.
好吧，
让我们结束这件事吧。

03:18.724 --> 03:21.172
Now, where are
the instructions?
现在，在哪里
说明？

03:21.241 --> 03:23.241
- I'll find them.
- [grunting
- 我会找到他们的。
- [咕哝

03:23.310 --> 03:25.137
- Instructions, instructions...
- 指示，指示……

03:25.206 --> 03:27.413
How to assemble...
- [yelps]
如何组装...
- [尖叫声]

03:27.482 --> 03:29.068
- Got them!
- 找到他们了！

03:29.137 --> 03:30.413
Hmm, step one.
嗯，第一步。

03:30.482 --> 03:33.172
- [moans]
- [呻吟]

03:33.241 --> 03:34.413
Give me that.
给我那个。

03:34.482 --> 03:35.758
Hmm--huh?
[wind blows]
嗯——嗯？
[风吹过]

03:35.827 --> 03:36.793
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:39.965 --> 03:40.965
[propeller whirs]
[螺旋桨呼呼地响]

03:41.034 --> 03:43.206
Now, what are we
supposed to do?
现在，我们是什么
应该做什么？

03:43.275 --> 03:44.793
- Don't worry, Squidward,
- 别担心，章鱼哥

03:44.862 --> 03:47.448
I know exactly
how to handle this situation.
我确切地知道
如何处理这种情况。

03:47.517 --> 03:48.758
- Oh, really?
- 哦真的吗？

03:48.827 --> 03:51.517
- We just need
to follow our hearts.
- 我们只需要
跟随我们的心。

03:51.586 --> 03:52.896
♪ La, la, la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦 ♪

03:52.965 --> 03:54.379
- Oh.
- 哦。

03:54.448 --> 03:56.379
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

03:56.448 --> 03:58.931
[groans]
Hmm...
[呻吟]
嗯...

03:59.000 --> 04:02.620
- Squidward,
I did the first piece.
- 章鱼哥，
我做了第一件作品。

04:02.689 --> 04:04.896
- SpongeBob, you clam-head,
- 海绵宝宝，你这个呆头呆脑的人，

04:04.965 --> 04:07.551
you don't put up
the mast first.
你不忍受
首先是桅杆。

04:07.620 --> 04:09.517
- [shouting]
What's that, Squidward?
- [喊叫]
那是什么，章鱼哥？

04:09.586 --> 04:12.931
- I said,
"SpongeBob, you clam-head"--
- 我说，
“海绵宝宝，你这个蛤蟆头”——

04:13.000 --> 04:15.793
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:15.862 --> 04:17.724
[moans]
[呻吟声]

04:19.206 --> 04:20.482
- Hey!
- 嘿！

04:20.551 --> 04:24.000
- You have to start
with the frame.
- 你必须开始
与框架。

04:25.586 --> 04:29.344
All right,
now bend it into a boat shape.
好吧，
现在将其弯曲成船形。

04:29.413 --> 04:30.965
D'oh!
噢！

04:31.034 --> 04:33.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:33.344 --> 04:34.689
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

04:34.758 --> 04:36.551
[whistles and clangs]
[口哨声和叮当声]

04:37.793 --> 04:39.655
- Tickle, tickle, tickle.
- 挠痒痒，挠痒痒，挠痒痒。

04:39.724 --> 04:42.034
- SpongeBob,
wood planks are not--
- 海绵宝宝，
木板不是——

04:42.103 --> 04:45.103
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:45.172 --> 04:46.344
- Ticklish.
- 怕痒。

04:46.413 --> 04:47.965
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

04:48.034 --> 04:49.620
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:49.689 --> 04:51.586
[whistles and clangs]
[口哨声和叮当声]

04:56.827 --> 04:59.275
- We did it, Squidward.
Put her there.
- 我们做到了，章鱼哥。
把她放在那里。

04:59.344 --> 05:02.034
- [weakly]
Hooray.
- [微弱]
万岁。

05:02.103 --> 05:03.413
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:03.482 --> 05:04.620
Whoa! Ha!
哇！哈!

05:04.689 --> 05:06.551
Ooh! Hey! Aah!
哦！嘿！啊啊！

05:06.620 --> 05:09.034
Aah! Ooh! Hey! Aah!
啊啊！哦！嘿！啊啊！

05:09.103 --> 05:10.137
Uh-oh!
呃-哦！

05:10.206 --> 05:11.586
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

05:11.655 --> 05:13.275
- [gasps] Huh?
- [喘气] 啊？

05:13.344 --> 05:15.241
[growls]
[咆哮]

05:15.310 --> 05:18.206
What in the name of all
that's salty are you doing?
以所有人的名义
你做的那个很咸吗？

05:18.275 --> 05:21.068
You're wasting
expensive lumber-er-er-er.
你在浪费
expensive lumber-er-er-er.

05:21.137 --> 05:24.896
- We're trying to build
the ship's frame, Mr. Krabs.
- 我们正在努力构建
船体，蟹老板。

05:24.965 --> 05:26.310
- Pfft.
- 噗。

05:26.379 --> 05:28.517
Building the frame?
构建框架？

05:28.586 --> 05:31.310
They give you one
all ready to go.
他们给你一个
一切准备就绪。

05:31.379 --> 05:32.655
- Ooh!
- 哦！

05:32.724 --> 05:34.448
- Take a gander, boy-o.
- 看一看，男孩。

05:34.517 --> 05:36.379
- Ooh--
- 噢--

05:36.448 --> 05:37.586
[gags]
[笑点]

05:37.655 --> 05:39.931
I'm shipshape, Mr. Krabs.
我很健康，蟹老板。

05:40.000 --> 05:42.655
- Now get back to work.
The tide's going out.
- 现在回去工作吧。
潮水要退了。

05:42.724 --> 05:45.413
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:45.482 --> 05:47.724
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

05:47.793 --> 05:50.689
[orchestral music]
[管弦乐]

05:50.758 --> 05:57.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:00.482 --> 06:02.965
- Oh, a stubborn one, eh?
- 哦，一个固执的人，是吗？

06:03.034 --> 06:05.655
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:05.724 --> 06:07.310
[sighs]
Mm-hmm.
[叹气]
嗯嗯。

06:07.379 --> 06:09.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:10.000 --> 06:11.310
- Hmm...
- 唔...

06:11.379 --> 06:13.000
[strains]
[菌株]

06:13.068 --> 06:14.517
- Hmm? Huh?
- 唔？啊？

06:14.586 --> 06:15.551
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

06:15.620 --> 06:18.241
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

06:18.310 --> 06:20.241
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:20.310 --> 06:21.758
Huh--whoa!
哈——哇！

06:21.827 --> 06:24.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:25.034 --> 06:26.310
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:26.379 --> 06:28.310
[growls]
[咆哮]

06:28.379 --> 06:29.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:29.448 --> 06:31.413
Huh?
[strains]
啊？
[菌株]

06:31.482 --> 06:33.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:33.862 --> 06:35.517
[moans]
- Squidward!
[呻吟声]
- 章鱼哥！

06:35.586 --> 06:37.379
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:37.448 --> 06:38.931
- Did you see an anchor?
- 你看到锚了吗？

06:39.000 --> 06:41.344
I think I dropped one.
我想我掉了一个。

06:41.413 --> 06:44.241
- Why don't we switch places?
- 我们为什么不换个地方呢？

06:44.310 --> 06:49.000
You work down here
and I'll work up there.
你在这里工作
我会在那里工作。

06:50.379 --> 06:52.310
[sighs]
Much safer.
[叹气]
安全得多。

06:52.379 --> 06:53.965
Never work below an idiot.
永远不要在白痴之下工作。

06:54.034 --> 06:56.482
- Oops!
Look out above!
- 哎呀！
往上看！

06:56.551 --> 06:57.482
- Above?
- 多于？

06:57.551 --> 07:00.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:00.862 --> 07:03.103
That's it!
就是这样！

07:03.172 --> 07:07.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:07.482 --> 07:09.517
- Huh--whoa!
- 哈--哇！

07:09.586 --> 07:11.034
Oh, hi, Squidward.
- [growls]
哦，嗨，章鱼哥。
- [咆哮]

07:11.103 --> 07:14.068
- Have you seen a safe up here?
I think I dropped it.
- 你看到这里有保险箱吗？
我想我把它扔掉了。

07:14.137 --> 07:15.241
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

07:16.586 --> 07:17.793
[growls]
[咆哮]

07:17.862 --> 07:20.482
From now on,
you're working next to me
从现在开始，
你在我旁边工作

07:20.551 --> 07:22.724
where I can keep an eye on you.
我可以在哪里监视你。

07:22.793 --> 07:25.137
- Aw, that's so sweet,
Squidward.
- 噢，太甜蜜了，
章鱼哥。

07:25.206 --> 07:26.241
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:26.310 --> 07:27.206
[explosion]
[爆炸]

07:31.103 --> 07:32.896
- Wow.
- 哇。

07:32.965 --> 07:37.862
Mr. Krabs,
your ship is finished!
蟹老板先生，
你的船已经完成了！

07:37.931 --> 07:41.413
- We use the term "ship"
very loosely.
- 我们使用“船”一词
非常宽松。

07:41.482 --> 07:42.413
[gull cries]
[海鸥的叫声]

07:42.482 --> 07:43.586
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:43.655 --> 07:45.586
[foghorn blows]
[雾号吹响]

07:45.655 --> 07:48.172
Hmm,
she's a little off the beam.
嗯，
她有点偏离正轨了。

07:48.241 --> 07:49.310
Hmm...
唔...

07:49.379 --> 07:50.758
Hmm, I know!
嗯，我知道！

07:50.827 --> 07:53.689
All she needs is a nice,
shiny coat of paint.
她所需要的只是一个美好的，
闪亮的油漆层。

07:53.758 --> 07:54.862
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:54.931 --> 07:58.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:58.344 --> 08:01.965
The S.S. Sea-cret Formula
is ready to set sail...
S.S. Sea-cret 配方
已准备好起航……

08:02.034 --> 08:05.413
as soon as you two drag her
into the lagoon.
只要你们两个拖着她
进入泻湖。

08:05.482 --> 08:08.275
[both strain]
[两种菌株]

08:08.344 --> 08:09.413
- Mush!
- 糊涂！

08:09.482 --> 08:12.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:12.517 --> 08:14.172
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

08:14.241 --> 08:18.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:19.000 --> 08:21.655
[bell dings]
[铃声]

08:21.724 --> 08:23.379
- [hums]
- [哼哼]

08:23.448 --> 08:24.827
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

08:28.068 --> 08:32.068
Well, at least this weekend
isn't a total waste.
好吧，至少这个周末
并不是完全浪费。

08:32.137 --> 08:34.551
- Not so fast, Mr. Squidward.
- 没那么快，章鱼哥先生。

08:34.620 --> 08:36.655
You still have work to do.
你还有工作要做。

08:36.724 --> 08:38.310
- Huh? Work?
- 啊？工作？

08:38.379 --> 08:40.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:40.344 --> 08:41.241
[bell dings]
[铃声]

08:41.310 --> 08:42.482
- Welcome to the grand opening
- 欢迎来到盛大开幕

08:42.551 --> 08:45.551
of the Krusty Krab
of the high seas...
蟹堡王的
公海的...

08:45.620 --> 08:47.758
and even higher prices.
甚至更高的价格。

08:47.827 --> 08:49.310
[laughs]
[笑]

08:49.379 --> 08:51.103
- Huh! Forget it!
- 哈！忘了它！

08:51.172 --> 08:54.241
I am not moving from this spot.
我不会离开这个地方。

08:54.310 --> 08:55.793
- No problem.
- 没问题。

08:55.862 --> 08:56.896
- Huh?
- 啊？

08:56.965 --> 09:00.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:00.827 --> 09:02.827
- How exciting, Squidward!
- 多么令人兴奋啊，章鱼哥！

09:02.896 --> 09:04.793
I get to flip patties and be--
我要翻转馅饼然后——

09:04.862 --> 09:07.517
[gags]
Seasick at the same time.
[笑点]
同时晕船。

09:07.586 --> 09:09.344
[retches]
[干呕]

09:09.413 --> 09:12.724
- We're not gonna sell any food
in the middle of a lagoon!
- 我们不会出售任何食物
在泻湖中央！

09:12.793 --> 09:18.000
- I'd like one Krabby Patty
combo with extra combo on it.
- 我想要一份蟹肉饼
组合上有额外的组合。

09:18.068 --> 09:19.655
[ka-ching]
[嘉庆]

09:19.724 --> 09:22.793
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:22.862 --> 09:23.827
[bell dings]
[铃声]

09:23.896 --> 09:26.310
[gags, retches]
[作呕，干呕]

09:26.379 --> 09:27.758
- Your order.
- 你的订单。

09:27.827 --> 09:31.000
- At ease, sailor.
- 放心，水手。

09:31.068 --> 09:32.793
[slurps drink]
- [sighs]
[喝水]
- [叹气]

09:32.862 --> 09:34.379
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:34.448 --> 09:35.551
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:35.620 --> 09:37.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:37.413 --> 09:40.275
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

09:42.896 --> 09:45.379
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

09:45.448 --> 09:47.413
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

09:47.482 --> 09:48.620
Whee!
哎哟！

09:48.689 --> 09:50.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:50.931 --> 09:53.137
Yeah!
[laughs]
是的！
[笑]

09:53.206 --> 09:54.448
Whoo!
呼！

09:54.517 --> 09:56.310
both: Mmm!
两人：嗯！

09:56.379 --> 09:58.482
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:58.551 --> 10:00.103
[cheering]
[欢呼]

10:02.517 --> 10:09.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:10.482 --> 10:12.724
- Whoa!
- 哇！

10:12.793 --> 10:14.896
[ka-ching]
[嘉庆]

10:14.965 --> 10:17.241
- Huh? Hmm...
- 啊？唔...

10:17.310 --> 10:20.344
I didn't know there was
an island in Goo Lagoon.
我不知道有
古泻湖中的一个岛屿。

10:20.413 --> 10:21.793
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

10:21.862 --> 10:25.034
- [laughs]
- Huh?
- [笑]
- 啊？

10:25.103 --> 10:29.344
Butt-berg, dead ahead!
巴特伯格，就在前方！

10:29.413 --> 10:30.413
- [gasps] Huh?
- [喘气] 啊？

10:30.482 --> 10:32.517
Everyone, hold fast!
- Whoa!
大家一定要坚持住！
- 哇！

10:32.586 --> 10:35.931
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:36.000 --> 10:39.241
[screams]
[bell rings]
[尖叫声]
[铃声响起]

10:40.310 --> 10:41.620
[horn blows]
[号角吹响]

10:41.689 --> 10:43.965
- Great Neptune's nose hair!
- 伟大的海王星的鼻毛！

10:44.034 --> 10:46.103
- [screams, grunts]
- [尖叫声、咕哝声]

10:46.172 --> 10:47.379
- [screams, grunts]
[bell rings]
- [尖叫声、咕哝声]
[铃声响起]

10:47.448 --> 10:48.517
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

10:48.586 --> 10:49.655
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

10:49.724 --> 10:52.310
[scraping]
[刮]

10:54.206 --> 10:55.172
Hmm?
唔？

10:55.241 --> 10:58.137
[strains]
[菌株]

10:58.206 --> 10:59.310
Hmm...
唔...

10:59.379 --> 11:01.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:01.275 --> 11:02.793
[Squidward playing "Taps"]
[章鱼哥演奏“Taps”]

11:02.862 --> 11:06.620
- One double Krabby Patty,
please.
- 一张双人蟹肉饼，
请。

11:06.689 --> 11:07.931
[ka-ching]
[嘉庆]

11:08.000 --> 11:11.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:11.413 --> 11:14.379
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

11:28.517 --> 11:31.413
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

11:31.482 --> 11:35.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:35.310 --> 11:38.655
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

11:38.724 --> 11:41.448
Give me all the Krabby Patties
you got, kid.
把所有的蟹黄饼都给我
你有，孩子。

11:41.517 --> 11:42.758
Oh, I'm so hungry,
哦，我好饿，

11:42.827 --> 11:45.827
I could eat at the Chum Bucket
and like it.
我可以在 Chum Bucket 吃饭
并喜欢它。

11:45.896 --> 11:47.965
Boy, I'll tell you--
[retches]
孩子，我告诉你——
[干呕]

11:48.034 --> 11:49.413
- [sighs]
Oh, boy.
- [叹气]
哦，男孩。

- [叹气]
哦，男孩。